course: dictionary
lesson: 15062
title: Revising, studying again and making better
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Revising means studying again what you have learned before, so it stays in your head. Before a test, you go back over your notes and spellings. «Mia is revising her spellings for Friday's test.» She is not learning new spellings. She is going over ones she already knows.
explain: Revising also means changing and improving a piece of writing, a plan or an idea. «Sam revised his story after his teacher read it.» Sam changed the parts that were unclear, so the story became better.
explain: Look at the words around revising to find its meaning. If the sentence is about a test or exam, it means studying again. If it is about a story or a plan, it means changing it to make it better. Then try your meaning in the sentence and check that it still makes sense.
fact: «Revising» means studying again what you have learned before, to get ready for a test or exam.
fact: «Revising» also means changing and improving a piece of writing, a plan or an idea.
fact: The base word is revise. Revises, revised and revising are its other forms.
fact: In the USA, people often say «reviewing» or «studying» instead of revising for a test.
fact: In writing, you plan, draft, revise, edit and publish. Revising makes your writing better.
exercise: «Ben is revising for his maths test tonight.» What does revising mean here? | Losing his pencil case | Going to bed early | Painting a picture of his house | *Studying again what he has learned before
exercise: «Ella revised her story to make the ending clearer.» What does revised mean here? | *Changed it to make it better | Copied it from a library book | Threw it away | Read it out loud very fast
exercise: In the USA, people say reviewing or studying where we say revising. Which word is the USA word for revising? | Relaxing | Recycling | *Reviewing | Revealing
test: «We spent all weekend revising our plan for the school garden.» What does revising mean in this sentence? | Forgetting the plan completely | *Changing the plan to make it better | Studying the plan for a test | Painting the garden fence
test: In writing, which step comes straight after the first draft? | *Revise | Publish | Draft again | Plan
exam: Which sentence uses revising to mean studying again for a test? | Maya is cooking her tea | Maya is painting her bedroom door | Maya is feeding the cat | *Maya is revising her spellings before Friday
